          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP478 Cut Bank Point

Left camp to go find this late in the day. Made the find at 10:00 pm now on to the Trans Canada Trail Multi-Cutbank cache. Really enjoying the long summer nights!&lt;/p&gt;

